    "notes": "Named Флигель Кузминских POI and way167382261 identify this house independently from Tolstoy and Volkonsky houses. The mapped long southeast edge fixes+X southwest along the facade and+Z southeast into the front garden; axes baked east/up/south, heading0. Ordinary southeast and northeast photographs confirm the compact five-bay long fronts, central arched upper opening/pediment and northeast side porch. Photo-visible balcony, treads and side porch extend outside the simple map rectangle. Retained standard Protomaps20261020 and Mapzen ground; outside front garden provider[0,7] supplies227.14409009244258m datum. Main boundary grades-0.048..0.944m, floor+1.2m and closed foundation-0.3m. Original garden/approaches, estate neighbors, roads and ponds remain. Coarse exposed plinth, historical thresholds and accessibility approximate; no bespoke terrain or flattening. Inspected initial native front/side views: white mass and green roof align with the mapped garden paths; closed plinth, front stairs and open side porch are supported. One owned house is replaced,242 resident independent buildings and original roads/pond water remain. Rear threshold treads approximate the coarse slope; historic levels and accessibility remain approximate. The one owned house is replaced while242 resident/294 wider independent buildings, original garden/approach ground, roads and40070.675m² pond water remain. Failure retains all243 originals; every LOD/failure/unload case restores ground/water and releases geometry."
  },
